<title>USA: Main Street names Bart Brown president.</title>
<headline>Main Street names Bart Brown president.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Main Street and Main Inc said Bart Brown, currently a director of the company, was named president and chief executive officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The company said the former president and CEO, Joe Panter, will stay on as a director and will oversee the company's new business development effort.</p>
</text>
